its. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service. LIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV STREAMING ACCOUNT WITH DEVICE. May not be combined with certain offers. Offer may be changed or discontinued at any time. Offer not available to U-verse TV customers.","monthlyDue":"Due monthly","componentKey":"messageKeys","WithoutDevice":"This is a limited-time offer. Offer not available to U-verse TV customers. \u003cb\u003eMust maintain [[packageName]] package or above.\u003c/b\u003e Customer must activate service and account must remain in good standing to receive all credits. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service. LIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT. May not be combined with certain offers. Offer may be changed or discontinued at any time.","deviceNewText":"New","tazDeviceName":"Gemini Device","topBannerLine1":"Need help with your order? Call us at ","topBannerLine2":"We have been unable to reach an agreement with certain programming providers. Certain stations in parts of the country are currently unavailable. Check tvpromise.com to learn more. ","dtvStreamingApp":"DIRECTV Streaming App","taxesAndCharges":"Plus taxes. ","logoUrlTemplate1":"/dtvassets/global/channel-icons/[[logoFolder]]/Channel_Icon_[[logoName]]_100x100.svg","msgDescTaxContent":". + taxes \u0026 fees.","msgContractContent":"* for 24 months + taxes \u0026 fees","msgTaxesRSNContent":"Added at checkout, Advanced Receiver Service Fee $[[advancedReceiverFee]]/mo. and Regional Sports Fee up to $23.99/mo. are extra \u0026 apply.","msgTazContractDisc":"*New approved residential customers only. Early agmt termination fee applies ($20/mo.) \u0026 add’l fee(s) may apply if equip. not returned. Credit card req’d (except MA \u0026 PA). Restr’s apply.","taxCalcPlaceHolder":"Taxes","tazLeaseDeviceName":"Lease device","deviceNewTazContract":"Gemini Air","mavEligibleOfferText":"\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003eMAVS FAN $50 CREDIT OFFER\u003c/u\u003e: Offer ends 12/28/21.\u003c/b\u003e Offer available to the first 10,000 new subscribers in limited zip codes only. Offer not available to DIRECTV or U-verse TV customers switching to DIRECTV STREAM. Requires purchase of CHOICE Package or higher (currently min. $84.99/mo.) plus tax where applicable. Customer must order new DIRECTV STREAM service through the dedicated website. \u003cb\u003eBy subscribing, you agree DIRECTV may share your DIRECTV STREAM account related information with the Dallas Mavericks for use pursuant to the privacy policy found \u003ca href= 'https://www.nba.com/privacy-policy' target= '_blank'\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/b\u003e Customer must activate service and account must remain in good standing to receive all 5 credits on method of payment. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service, switch min. required package or move out of the eligible zip codes. Offer may be changed or discontinued at any time. First credit to your method of payment will be delivered to customer within 3-5 days after expiration of 14-day BRE. Subsequent credits to your method of payment will be delivered monthly thereafter. Not valid for purchase by groups, clubs, businesses or organizations. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV STREAM ACCOUNT.\u003c/b\u003e May be combined with other promotional offers on same services. \u003cb\u003eAll offers, programming, promotions, pricing, terms, restrictions \u0026amp; conditions subject to change \u0026amp; may be modified, discontinued, or terminated at any time without notice.\u003c/b\u003e","tazContractDeviceName":"Gemini Air Device","dtvStreamingAppToolTip":"Use the DIRECTV App to stream live TV, recordings, and On Demand programming, including local channels, on the go.","deviceRefurbTazContract":"Gemini","deviceNewTazContractDash":" Gemini Air","unltdCloudDvrCartToolTip":"Record and store hours of HD entertainment to enjoy again later.","deviceCertifiedRestoreText":"Certified R