cription to discovery+, your $2.00 discount to your monthly bill will stop. By selecting this offer, you agree that your subscription to discovery+ auto-renews monthly at then prevailing rate (currently $[[basePrice]] + taxes) and that DIRECTV will charge the provided method of payment on a monthly basis, unless you cancel your subscription online via directv.com. Cancel anytime at directv.com. May only be accessed on DIRECTV device(s), directv.com, and the DIRECTV app. Subscription not valid for streaming using the discovery+ app or \u003ca href='https://www.discoveryplus.com' target='_blank'\u003ediscoveryplus.com\u003c/a\u003e. This offer is subject to discontinuation, change or cancellation at any time.","strikePrice":false,"imageUrlIncl":"/dtvassets/sales/directv/logos/channel-logos/amc_black.png","regPriceText":"(Reg. $[[regPrice]]/mo.)","bannerContent":"$2 OFF LIMITED OFFER ","isOfferRibbon":true,"modalImageUrl":"/dtvassets/sales/pcp/logos/channels/modals/discovery-plus-color.png","isSpecialOffer":false,"isEligibleCustomer":false,"autoRenewDescription":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eRENEWALS\u003c/b\u003e: Subscription renews monthly during regular season and automatically renews each season at the then-prevailing rate (currently [[priceText]] during the NBA regular season for up to 6 months) unless cancelled or you opt-out of auto renewal. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eCANCELLATIONS\u003c/b\u003e: Cancel anytime online or by calling 800.531.5000. New DIRECTV customers who cancel service prior to free trial expiration will receive a full refund. Otherwise, no refunds or credits for any partial-month periods or unwatched content. However, once you’ve cancelled, you can access NBA League Pass Premium through any remaining monthly period. \u003c/p\u003e","seeWhatYouGetContent":{"_uid":"e2c86520-2e8b-4937-883e-7e99f8073f3f","heading":"discovery+ is the streaming service with something for everyone. Your favorite genres and brands, including HGTV, Food Network, TLC, ID, Animal Planet, Discovery Channel, plus exclusive Originals, all in one place. Whatever you’re into, you’ll find it here."},"svgMarkup":"\u003csvg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\u003e\u003cclipPath id=\"a\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m0 0h100v100h-100z\"/\u003e\u003c/clipPath\u003e\u003cpattern id=\"b\" height=\"1\" patternContentUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" width=\"1\"\u003e\u003cimage height=\"500\" transform=\"scale(.002)\" width=\"500\" xlink:href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"/\u003e\u003c/pattern\u003e\u003cg clip-path=\"url(#a)\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m0 0h100v100h-100z\" fill=\"url(#b)\"/\u003e\u003c/g\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e"},{"_uid":"9bc8baf1-b477-4654-8b17-4b3c6fa8e760","name":"Curiosity Stream","altText":"Curiosity Stream logo","ranking":"17","ribbons":{"_uid":"1f078402-1abd-4734-8ec5-ca612566042e","dollarIconUrl":"https://www.directv.com/assets/content/id8e97z4bd/svg/fusion-offers-icon-green700.svg","dealRibbonText":"INCREDIBLE DEAL!","showDealRibbon":false,"recommendedRibbonText":"RECOMMENDED","showRecommendedRibbon":false},"isHidden":false,"imageUrl2":" /assets/content/obyzawckyc/svg/Channel-Icon-CuriosityStream-100x100.svg","linkTitle":"See what you get","ariaAtomic":false,"closeTitle":"What you get","productSKU":"OF_BOLT-CURIOSITY-202505_RR","description":"By selecting this offer, you agree that your subscription to Curiosity Stream auto-renews monthly at the prevailing rate (Currently [[priceText]] + taxes) and that DIRECTV will charge the provided method of payment on a monthly basis, unless you cancel your subscription. Cancel anytime at directv.com . May only be accessed on DIRECTV devices, directv.com , and the DIRECTV app.","strikePrice":false,"isOfferRibbon":false,"modalImageUrl":"/assets/content/obyzawckyc/svg/Channel-Icon-CuriosityStream-100x100.svg","isSpecialOffer":false,"isEligibleCustomer":false,"seeWhatYouGetContent":{"_uid":"3d50398a-dc88-4528-b0af-2