Level Sports\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNFL Network\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNFL RedZone\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNHL Network\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOutdoor Channel\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSEC Network\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSportsman Channel\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTennis Channel \u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTUDN\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eWillow HD\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eWillow Xtra \u003c/li\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eOut-of-market Regional Sports Networks included with CHOICE pkg or higher:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e(accessibility based on customer location/ZIP Code)\u003c/p\u003e \u003cli\u003eAltitude Sports\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Detroit\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Florida\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Great Lakes\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Midwest\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports North\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Ohio\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports San Diego\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports SoCal\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports South\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Southeast\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Southwest\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Sun\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports West\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBally Sports Wisconsin\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMSG\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMSG SportsNet\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMarquee Sports Network\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMid-Atlantic Sports Network (MASN)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMid-Atlantic Sports Network 2 (MASN2)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMonumental Sports Network \u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNBC Sports Bay Area\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNBC Sports Boston\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNBC Sports California\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNBC Sports Chicago\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eNESN\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eRoot Sports Northwest\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSpace City Home Network\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSpectrum SportsNet\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSpectrum SportsNet LA\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSportsNet New York\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSportsNet Pittsburgh\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYankee Entertainment and Sports Network (YES)\u003c/li\u003e","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eGet your first month of DIRECTV Sports Pack on us!\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eLtd. time offer. New resid. customers w/ qual. pkg. DIRECTV Sports Pack auto-renews monthly after 1 mo. at then-prevailing rate (currently $[[price]]/mo. + tax) unless cancelled.\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith a monthly subscription to DIRECTV Sports Pack, you get access to specialty sports networks, pro networks, plus adventure programming, international soccer, golf, tennis, racing, and more. Also included for those with a base package of CHOICE \u0026 ULTIMATE, access to up to 35 out-of-market regional sports networks to view select live collegiate and high school games, as well as pre- and post-game commentary for select pro teams around the country.\u003c/p\u003e","strikePrice":false,"imageUrlIncl":"/dtvassets/sales/pcp/logos/sports/tiles/dtv-sportsPack-color.png","regPriceText":"then [[regPrice]]/mo.","isOfferRibbon":false,"modalImageUrl":"/dtvassets/sales/pcp/logos/sports/modals/dtv-sportsPack-color.png","isSpecialOffer":true,"promoPriceText":"1 month included","isEligibleCustomer":false,"seeWhatYouGetContent":{"_uid":"943eef12-8e18-4463-ad17-a54abbc1356b","heading":"\u003cp\u003eDIRECTV Sports Pack lets you access sports coverage from the U.S. and around the world, with over 40 regional and specialty sports networks (RSNs require CHOICE pkg and above)*. Enjoy a true fan experience for a wide variety of your favorite sports with in-demand content, like NFL RedZone and NFL Network, ESPNews, college sports networks, and more. \u003cbr /\u003e *Some channels may be incl. in base pkg. Visit \u003ca href='https://www.directv.com/sportspack' target='_blan