 receive separate information via email on how to activate your account.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eBy selecting this offer, you agree that your subscription to Apple TV+ auto-renews monthly at the prevailing rate (Currently [[priceText]] + taxes) and that DIRECTV will charge the provided method of payment on a monthly basis, unless you cancel your subscription. Cancel anytime at directv.com.\u003c/p\u003e","strikePrice":false,"isOfferRibbon":false,"modalImageUrl":"/dtvassets/global/channel-icons/a-b/Channel_Icon_BET+.svg","isSpecialOffer":false,"isEligibleCustomer":false,"trialLanguageLabel":"[[svodName]] subscription available for activation after the DIRECTV [[freeTrialDuration]]-day free trial period ends.","seeWhatYouGetContent":{"_uid":"b77064e3-50ad-4d0d-9bf2-e3507f3986c1","heading":"Apple TV+ offers award-winning Apple Original series and films, including dramas, comedies, and sci-fi. There are new Apple Originals added every month. Stream on Apple devices, smart TVs, consoles, or sticks."},"svgMarkup":"\u003csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\"\u003e\u003cg clip-path=\"url(#a)\"\u003e\u003cpath fill=\"#231F20\" d=\"M47.547 35.54v-6.053h-5.763v-2.66h5.765v-6.053h2.69v6.053h5.763v2.66h-5.766v6.053h-2.69ZM23.822 17.253v3.523h2.833v2.325h-2.833v8.288c0 1.283.564 1.874 1.803 1.874.339-.005.677-.029 1.014-.069v2.338a9.882 9.882 0 0 1-1.678.128c-2.929 0-4.071-1.126-4.071-3.973V23.1h-2.168v-2.325h2.17v-3.523h2.932-.002ZM36.567 35.54h-3.11l-5.233-14.764h3.097l3.67 11.864h.069l3.67-11.864h3.04L36.568 35.54Zm-23.81-15.816c-1.74-.127-3.212.97-4.032.97-.82 0-2.12-.943-3.48-.916a5.164 5.164 0 0 0-4.363 2.644c-1.859 3.225-.474 8.005 1.337 10.623.887 1.278 1.944 2.722 3.329 2.668 1.334-.053 1.84-.862 3.454-.862s2.069.862 3.48.839c1.438-.027 2.35-1.305 3.228-2.592a11.506 11.506 0 0 0 1.46-2.998 4.655 4.655 0 0 1-2.829-4.267c-.024-2.668 2.179-3.949 2.277-4.013-1.252-1.84-3.182-2.045-3.861-2.096Zm-1.076-1.728a4.64 4.64 0 0 0 1.097-3.3