 range of devices. Hardware and device capabilities for non-DIRECTV devices vary by manufacturer.","contentType":"textAndTootip"}]},{"_uid":"71883913-7fc0-4c30-a3d9-c6e85af47a94","cells":[{"_uid":"2bd25f3b-3781-4c97-9d41-a58b3e266b19","text":"Supports 4K video and Dolby Atmos 5.1","tooltip":"The Gemini Device supports 4k viewing and Dolby Atmos 5.1 surround sound, so you can enjoy your watching experience as if you were in a cinema.","contentType":"textAndTootip"},{"_uid":"b7dc4772-ea42-4179-86f1-c35cbab6584c","contentType":"check"},{"_uid":"5f011140-16b7-4ed1-bcd0-98c601d1b44c","text":"Dependent on device","tooltip":"DIRECTV service is compatible with a wide range of devices. Hardware and device capabilities for non-DIRECTV devices vary by manufacturer.","contentType":"textAndTootip"}]},{"_uid":"53006474-d8c4-4e05-b7a5-7a2c7ecb3d16","cells":[{"_uid":"cde04ac3-7424-4dbd-9049-75ac240a529b","text":"Smart home connectivity with Google Assistant","tooltip":"Use Google Assistant on the Gemini Device to control supported smart home devices","contentType":"textAndTootip"},{"_uid":"cf059e53-2d46-4724-845c-ea14bf9cc6ef","contentType":"check"},{"_uid":"e091b100-30a1-4be0-958e-4baefbc9a504","text":"Dependent on device","tooltip":"DIRECTV service is compatible with a wide range of devices. Hardware and device capabilities for non-DIRECTV devices vary by manufacturer.","contentType":"textAndTootip"}]},{"_uid":"c9a42c2b-18e4-4e0a-a910-5d85dbc994e0","cells":[{"_uid":"6a784a24-59fd-4bcf-b6d8-f9c2208a95e7","text":"Device dimensions","contentType":"text"},{"_uid":"ee468ac2-0b5e-4ff4-a6f9-f7056753d9d3","text":"1.8-inch H 2.25-inch W 6.25-inch D","contentType":"dimension"},{"_uid":"a4d0ba0c-a550-4bab-bf7d-c99ddbb73670","contentType":"empty"}]}],"outerBorder":false,"stickyColumn":false,"stickyHeader":false,"equalColWidth":false,"verticalLines":false,"horizontalLines":false,"rowColorPattern":false,"enableTextUpdate":false}],"centerImage":"/dtvassets/sales/pcp/modal/D_DIRECTV_Device_blank.png","checkimgUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/2022/fusion-checkmark-green500-fusion.svg","minusimgUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/2022/fusion-hyphen-neutral600-subtract.svg","images":[{"alt":"Gemini Device","_uid":"4e27fe9c-037e-4481-a79f-c86aab4e25b6","imageUrl":"/dtvassets/sales/pcp/imagery/gemini-air-dongle-learn-more-modal.svg"},{"alt":"A fully integrated TV experience","_uid":"0e99a44b-b791-4a5b-8f58-b2171d6141c2","imageUrl":"/dtvassets/sales/pcp/imagery/TV-learn-more-modal.svg","imageClass":"imageSize","imageContent":"A fully integrated TV experience","imageSubClass":"h3","imageContClass":"h3","imageSubContent":"Switch between live, recorded, and On Demand TV, or to apps like Max (formerly HBO Max™), Netflix, or Prime Video™ \u0026ndash; without missing a beat.*","subscriptionContent":"*Subscriptions required for 3\u003csup\u003erd\u003c/sup\u003e party providers."},{"alt":"Voice remote with Google Assistant","_uid":"677ba268-ef90-4c05-b07e-ffc5e789a3a8","imageUrl":"/dtvassets/sales/pcp/imagery/TV-remote-learn-more-modal.svg","imageClass":"imageSize","imageContent":"Voice remote powered\u003cbr\u003e by Google","imageSubClass":"fontBody2","imageContClass":"fontBody1","imageContentLeft":"It’s simple to use","imageContentRight":"The remote that helps with\u003cbr\u003e more than just TV","imageSubContentLeft":"Control live TV,\u003cbr\u003e apps, smart home\u003cbr\u003e devices*, and more\u003cbr\u003e with a single\u003cbr\u003e remote control.","subscriptionContent":"*Certain commands will depend on 3\u003csup\u003erd\u003c/sup\u003e party functionalities.","imageSubContentRight":"'Is it going to rain today?'\u003cbr\u003e'Launch Netflix'\u003cbr\u003e'Play some music'\u003cbr\u003e'Dim the lights'"},{"alt":"Access your favorite apps","_uid":"cb0a0ed9-25aa-4102-a836-794e1c4c5a21","imageUrl":"/dtvassets/sales/pcp/imagery/channel-icons_learn-more-modal.svg","imageClass":"imageSize","imageContent":"Access your favorite apps","imageSubClass":"fontBody2","imageContCl