plus taxes \u0026amp; fees for OPTIMO MÁS package) for VISA Reward Card. Autopay and Paperless Bill req’d. for Satellite.  Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.).  \u003cb\u003ePricing for two years. After 2 years, then month to month at then current prevailing prices unless cancelled. Additional Fees \u0026amp; Taxes:\u003c/b\u003e Price excludes Advanced Receiver Service Fee of $15/mo. (which is extra and applies to all packages) and Regional Sports Fee of up to $23.99/mo. which is extra \u0026amp; applies to CHOICE and/or MÁS ULTRA and higher Pkgs. Residents of select multi-dwelling units are not eligible for these offers. \u003cb\u003eRedemption:\u003c/b\u003e Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be sent a Reward Notification email with instructions for claiming the reward on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com/'\u003ewww.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Reward must be claimed by the date noted in the email (75 days from the date email was sent). If customer’s email returns as undeliverable, a letter will be mailed via USPS 3rd class mail. Reward invitation expires if not claimed by the date noted in Reward Notification. Customers can track their reward status anytime via the DIRECTV Reward Tracker, which is located on the DIRECTV Reward Center www.directv-rewardcenter.com.  Allow three (3) weeks after receipt and verification of customer’s claim for delivery card. DIRECTV is not responsible for late, lost or misdirected card in mail. Not valid for purchase by groups, clubs, businesses or organizations. Void where prohibited, licensed, taxed or restricted. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE $100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT.\u003c/b\u003e May not be combined with other reward card offers on same services. Card expires at month-end 6 months after issuance. For Cardholder Agreement, go to \u003cb\u003edirectv-rewardcenter.com.\u003c/b\u003e The DIRECTV Visa Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV.\u003c/p\u003e"}}},"productSKU":"OF_BASE-CHOICE-201811","packageName":"CHOICE™","strikeElement":false,"backgroundColor":"lightLapis.main","hideChannelList":false,"packageDescription":"125+ channels","hideCompareChannels":false}],"messageKeys":{"_uid":"444bd40c-d247-4b3b-9c9f-c42d7f7b1eb4","isVisible":false,"seeAll":"See all","removeCta":"Remove","AppliedText":"Applied","packageLabel":"Package","ariaLabelText":"See what movies, shows, sports, channels, and entertainment are included with this add-on","showAddOnsCta":"Show add-ons","hideSPAddOnsCta":"Hide subscriptions \u0026 add-ons","seeChannelAddons":"Shop streaming services \u0026 add-ons","cancelAnytimeText":"Taxes apply. Cancel anytime.","popularSelectName":"Popular","productHeaderText":"Streaming TV","removeAllSpecials":"Remove all specials","selectAllSpecials":"Select all specials","seeAllChannelsLink":"/channel-lineup/modal/?channels=internet\u0026cmprPkg=[[basePackage]]\u0026lang=[[language]]","seeAllChannelsText":"See all [[packageDescription]]","packageNotSelectedText":"Select a package first to see its available add-ons.","includedAddOnsSectionTitle":"Included with your order"},"componentKey":"condensedHeroPanel","modalContent":{"_uid":"1eec6e28-f6ff-498a-9267-690d097af7c9","buttonText":"Save and continue","modalTitle":"Change how you will get DIRECTV","bottomMessage":"*Changing your connection will remove all previous selections, including add-ons and devices.","transportTypeOptions":{"_uid":"b703a8c7-c141-4d5b-a230-96fb68fe01d8","internetOption":{"_uid":"494346ed-3a99-4d7e-9a32-86b806ed63a5","heading":"Use my home internet connection","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/component-controls/internet-icon.svg","isHidden":false,"description":"Best for homes with reliable high-speed internet."},"satelliteOption":{"_uid":"022e6ed2-c04f-4d51-9772-de2792d7f472","heading":"Connect with a satellite dish","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/component-controls/satellite-icon.svg","isHidden":false,"description":"Best for homes where a dish can be installed and areas without high-speed internet."}},"selectedOptionIconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/component-controls/toggle-transport-switch-selector-modal.svg"},"transportType":{"_uid":"609ae674-82ac-415c-87b7-f128883601dd","name":"Streaming TV","title":"Use my existing home internet","logoUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/component-controls/internet-icon.svg","tooltip":"Instead of using a satellite dish, you can stream DIRECTV wirelessly using your existing home internet. Streaming TV requires a third-party internet provider. 25 Mbps minimum internet speed is recommended","changeLink":"Change","streamingLogo":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/wifi-tablet-mobile-blue700.svg","containerHeading":"Build your DIRECTV plan","streamingLogoTitle":"Use existing home internet"},"heroPanelTemplate":{"_uid":"65c017a3-68fc-41b8-acdd-0ed0ced70a6c","offerList":"[[offerList]]","tradeMark":"[[tradeMark]]","productSKU":"[[productSKU]]","packageName":{"_uid":"73e24ff3-4ef3-4077-b6df-71cab6596824","content":"[[packageName]]"},"offerDetails":{"cta":{"_uid":"59522935-0766-435b-9f50-38a9ac725996","label":"[[legalCtaLabel]]","content":"[[legalModalContent]]","legalUrl":"[[legalModalURL]]"},"_uid":"ad4772a9-77c6-4db1-91f8-49a88e66630b","content":"[[offerTitle]]"},"packageLabel":{"_uid":"b90ea12c-3c45-4ef6-9890-7f188ace63e2","content":"[[packageLabel]]"},"pkgLogos":["[[pkgLogos]]"],"seeAllChannels":{"cta":{"_uid":"3077f408-ee54-41fc-af59-1f30ed227596","label":"[[seeAllChannelsText]]"},"_uid":"8445e16e-3e09-4ae5-9496-eea0d4210a69","modalData":{"url":"[[seeAllChannelsLink]]","_uid":"127ad6f4-4bd8-42d2-b5a2-04a6bdf1fde2"},"modalType":"iframe"},"backgroundColor":"[[backgroundColor]]"},"showOfferBannerFor":"[savenow]","promotionsAndRewards":{"_uid":"1d69f09a-4ce2-4b56-8b09-ff215fa7f5a5","title":"Promotions \u0026 rewards","genericOffers":[{"_uid":"e252fb21-8e4b-4591-9ead-d807498675b7","title":"Instant Savings","content":"\u003cspan\u003eGet $[[promotionAmount]] off your [[packageName]] package for [[promotionDuration]] months with streaming device! \u003c/span\u003e","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"248af602-1792-4145-a1ac-43a6258a3ae9","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cb\u003e$[[promotionAmount]] off for [[promotionDuration]] Months:\u003c/b\u003e [[saveNowLegalDescription]]"},"promoType":{"_uid":"e17f9f86-e0a7-43ac-9892-ba5cbb76dc3e","epochOfferType":"savenow","supportedPackages":["choice","optimo mas","premier","ultimate","entertainment"],"billingProductCode":["SAVENOW10OFF24MDVC","15OFF24MODVC","20OFF24MODVC","5OFF24MODVC"]}},{"_uid":"70162256-6520-43bc-a19b-3039613df606","title":"Instant Savings","content":"\u003cspan\u003eGet $[[promotionAmount]] off your [[packageName]] package for [[promotionDuration]] months! \u003c/span\u003e","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"dc3191d1-388a-43c1-9949-f2a8ce26d043","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cb\u003e$[[promotionAmount]] off for [[promotionDuration]] Months:\u003c/b\u003e [[saveNowLegalDescription]]"},"promoType":{"_uid":"84dedbd3-7bd0-429d-9a41-defe6c6de05a","epochOfferType":"savenow","supportedPackages":["choice","optimo mas","premier","ultimate","entertainment"],"billingProductCode":"10OFF3MONODVC"}},{"_uid":"6ab838f4-b86d-4831-a34f-12719155a4b7","title":"Instant Savings","content":"\u003cspan\u003eT-Mobile [[packageName]] package - Free for [[promotionDuration]] mo(s). \u003c/span\u003e","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","legalCta":{"_uid":"79bdcb15-638f-4222-853d-b3c2a34b4c77","label":"Offer details","enable":false,"legalContent":"\u003cb\u003eT-Mobile/DIRECTV OFFER:\u003c/b\u003e Offer valid only for DIRECTV \u003cb\u003eCHOICE package without device.\u003c/b\u003e A valid credit card is required and a temporary authorization hold may apply at sign-up. Both services must remain in good standing to receive promotional pricing. Offer is non-transferable, limited to one per eligible account, and must be redeemed on the same DIRECTV account associated with the qualifying T-Mobile Fiber subscription. Regional Sports Fee (RSF) is $0 during the promotional period and will apply at the then-current rate after the promotion ends (Currently up to $19.99/mo. - Varies by location; may be lower in some areas). If customer upgrades to a higher-priced DIRECTV package during the promotional period, the value of CHOICE promotional credit will be applied toward the upgraded package. If customer downgrades to a lower-priced package, promotional discounts are forfeited."},"promoType":{"_uid":"90718446-a07f-4ebd-a711-a3dec43e8e97","epochOfferType":"savenow","supportedPackages":["choice"],"billingProductCode":"TMOBILEDISCOUNT"},"isByodIneligible":false},{"_uid":"86031ef6-3736-44cf-a418-0ef878f6942d","title":"Exclusive offer","content":"With ENTERTAINMENT you scored a $100 VISA Reward Card!","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/promo-rewards-blue700-giftcard-icon.svg","ranking":"2","promoType":{"_uid":"2bee1413-02dc-4509-a406-fc16267accc3","supportedPackages":["prod_dummy"]},"proximityLegal":{"_uid":"3da787ab-442d-4699-a363-a83b2b90acf1","content":"New customers. Req’d 24 mo. Agreement. Redemption req’d.","legalCta":{"_uid":"44ec2834-5f69-468a-a55c-e7ac846e18c8","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003e$100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cb\u003eLimited Time Offer.\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;Must maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. Customer must order new DIRECTV service (min. $69.99/mo. for 24 mos. plus taxes \u0026amp; fees) for VISA Reward Card. Autopay and Paperless Bill req’d. for Satellite.\u0026nbsp; Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.).\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eAdditional Fees \u0026amp; Taxes:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003ePrice excludes Advanced Receiver Service Fee of $15/mo. (which is extra and applies to all packages) and Regional Sports Fee of up to $23.99/mo. which is extra \u0026amp; applies to CHOICE and/or MÁS ULTRA and higher Pkgs.\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eRedemption\u003c/b\u003e: Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be sent a Reward Notification email with instructions for claiming the reward on the DIRECTV Reward Center\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com/'\u003ewww.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Reward must be claimed by the date noted in the email (75 days from the date email was sent). If customer’s email returns as undeliverable, a letter will be mailed via USPS 3rd class mail. Reward invitation expires if not claimed by the date noted in Reward Notification. Customers can track their reward status anytime via the DIRECTV Reward Tracker, which is located on the DIRECTV Reward Center www.directv-rewardcenter.com.\u0026nbsp; Allow three (3) weeks after receipt and verification of customer’s claim for delivery card. DIRECTV is not responsible for late, lost or misdirected card in mail. Not valid for purchase by groups, clubs, businesses or organizations. Void where prohibited, licensed, taxed or restricted.\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE $100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eMay not be combined with other reward card offers on same services. Card expires at month-end 6 months after issuance. For Cardholder Agreement, go to\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003edirectv-rewardcenter.com.\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;The DIRECTV Visa Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV.\u003c/p\u003e"}}},{"_uid":"e3f7b887-f018-4757-ba04-14fb956b7a43","title":"Exclusive offer","content":"With ULTIMATE you scored a $100 VISA Reward Card!","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/promo-rewards-blue700-giftcard-icon.svg","ranking":"2","promoType":{"_uid":"14207559-e78f-4413-9611-90fb3581dbca","supportedPackages":["prod_dummy"]},"proximityLegal":{"_uid":"720238e3-88b0-420a-879e-fd274417ec8a","content":"New customers. Req’d 24mo. Agreement. Redemption req’d.","legalCta":{"_uid":"826bc860-0582-4810-b22c-abae1345e2d5","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003e$100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER: \u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cb\u003eLimited Time Offer.\u003c/b\u003e Must maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. Customer must order new DIRECTV service (min. $69.99/mo. for 24 mos. plus taxes \u0026amp; fees) for VISA Reward Card. Autopay and Paperless Bill req’d. for Satellite.\u0026nbsp; Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.).\u0026nbsp; \u003cb\u003eAdditional Fees \u0026amp; Taxes: \u003c/b\u003ePrice excludes Advanced Receiver Service Fee of $15/mo. (which is extra and applies to all packages) and Regional Sports Fee of up to $23.99/mo. w