 Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV.\u003c/p\u003e"}}},{"_uid":"af15d216-486c-495c-9699-741db426737d","title":"Exclusive offer","content":"With OPTIMO MAS you scored a $100 VISA Reward Card!","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/promo-rewards-blue700-giftcard-icon.svg","ranking":"2","promoType":{"_uid":"edb74fd0-e02b-480a-bd8d-575a5760fe6f","supportedPackages":["prod_dummy"]},"proximityLegal":{"_uid":"4f464443-5783-4b60-9ea3-3c5ac2e1beb6","content":"New customers. Req’d 24mo. Agreement. Redemption req’d.","legalCta":{"_uid":"1dfd5a45-65df-4776-85b1-1564e36d6066","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003e$100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cb\u003eLimited Time Offer.\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;Must maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. Customer must order new DIRECTV service (min. $69.99/mo. for 24 mos. plus taxes \u0026amp; fees) for VISA Reward Card. Autopay and Paperless Bill req’d. for Satellite.\u0026nbsp; Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.).\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eAdditional Fees \u0026amp; Taxes:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003ePrice excludes Advanced Receiver Service Fee of $15/mo. (which is extra and applies to all packages) and Regional Sports Fee of up to $23.99/mo. which is extra \u0026amp; applies to CHOICE and/or MÁS ULTRA and higher Pkgs.\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eRedemption\u003c/b\u003e: Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be