der Agreement, go to \u003cb\u003edirectv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/b\u003e. The DIRECTV Visa Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE VISA REWARD CARD OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cb\u003eAll offers may be changed or discontinued at any time.\u003c/b\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"b8c78777-8557-4468-9da2-8d790a77b41d","supportedPackages":["prod_dummy"]}},{"_uid":"98bff84a-8f11-4372-85dc-bfbacce08a17","title":"Exclusive offer","content":"Get an extra $100 DIRECTV Visa® Reward Card when you sign up for both Movies Extra Pack and Lifetime Movie Club!","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/promo-rewards-blue700-giftcard-icon.svg","ranking":"2","legalCta":{"_uid":"0d920cc2-12e6-4470-93a7-a452a275e4da","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cb\u003eVISA REWARD CARD OFFER:\u003c/b\u003e Must maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. To qualify for $200 VISA Reward Card, customer must sign up for ENTERTAINMENT package or higher, Movies Extra Pack and Lifetime Movie Club and maintain all three services for 3 mos. (Customers selecting only ENTERTAINMENT Package or higher and Movies Extra Pack only qualify for $100 VISA Reward Card). Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.). Residents of select multi-dwelling units are not eligible for this offer. \u003cb\u003eRedemption:\u003c/b\u003e Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be sent a Reward Notification email with instructions for claiming the reward on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com' target='_blank'\u003ewww.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Reward must be claimed by the date noted in the email (75 days from the date email was sent). If customer’s email returns as undeliverable, a letter will be mailed via USPS 3rd class mail. Reward invitation expires if not claimed by the date noted in Reward Notification. Customers can track their reward status anytime via the DIRECTV Reward Tracker, which is located on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com' target='_blank'\u003ewww.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e.  Allow three (3) weeks after receipt and verification of customer’s claim for delivery card. DIRECTV is not responsible for late, lost or misdirected card in mail. Not valid for purchase by groups, clubs, businesses or organizations. Void where prohibited, licensed, taxed or restricted. May not be combined with other reward card offers on same services. Card expires at month-end 6 months after issuance. For Cardholder Agreement, go to \u003cb\u003edirectv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/b\u003e. The DIRECTV Visa Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE VISA REWARD CARD OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cb\u003eAll offers may be changed or discontinued at any time.\u003c/b\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"9728d99b-acaf-4ccc-a772-b772c0884cba","supportedPackages":["prod_dummy"]}},{"_uid":"3746312a-7509-40c7-ad58-a27283276955","title":"Instant Savings","content":"Score a $100 DIRECTV Visa® Reward Card when you use promo code SLAMDUNK at checkout!","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"9fa269a9-2675-4452-ad33-b398a7042784","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e$100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER: Must use SLAMDUNK code at checkout. Offer Ends 3/31/25.\u003c/strong\u003e Must maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. Customer must order new DIRECTV via Internet service for VISA Reward Card. Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.). \u003cstrong\u003eRedemption:\u003c/strong\u003e Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be sent a Reward Notification email with instructions for claiming the reward on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='https://www.directv-rewardcenter.com' target='_blank'\u003ewww.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Reward must be claimed by the date noted in the email (75 days from the date email was sent). If customer’s email returns as undeliverable, a letter will be mailed via USPS 3rd class mail. Reward invitation expires if not claimed by the date noted in Reward Notification. Customers can track their reward status anytime via the DIRECTV Reward Tracker, which is located on the DIRECTV Reward Center www.directv-rewardcenter.com. Allow three (3) weeks after receipt and verification of customer’s claim for delivery card. DIRECTV is not responsible for late, lost or misdirected card in mail. Not valid for purchase by groups, clubs, businesses or organizations. Void where prohibited, licensed, taxed or restricted. May not be combined with other reward card offers on same services. Card expires at month-end 6 months after issuance. For Cardholder Agreement, go to \u003cstrong\u003edirectv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/strong\u003e. The DIRECTV Visa Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV. \u003c/br\u003e\u003c/br\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e LIMIT ONE $100 GIFT CARD OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT.\u003c/strong\u003e May not be combined with certain offers.\u003cstrong\u003e Offers may be changed or discontinued at any time.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"5e83a05d-e050-44df-bb8d-b21f4c527851","supportedPackages":["prod_dummy"]},"cartContent":"vScore a $100 DIRECTV Visa® Reward Card when you use promo code SLAMDUNK at checkout!"},{"_uid":"08be9716-1e3b-46cf-bcae-1db5298c7b0d","title":"Instant Savings","content":"Start streaming DIRECTV and save $25 your first month!","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"96610298-7aec-453d-9e2d-2c8242355f55","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cb\u003eSAVE $25 OFFER: Limited Time Offer.\u003c/b\u003e New and returning DIRECTV customers only. Requires CHOICE package or higher (currently min. $124.98/mo. for 24 mos. w/ req'd Regional Sports Fee of up to $23.99/mo. \u0026 optional $10/mo. Gemini lease fee). Prices subject to change. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV STREAMING ACCOUNT.\u003c/b\u003e May not be combined with certain offers. \u003cb\u003eOffer may end or change at any time.\u003c/b\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"c1a6acae-4396-4197-aadc-eae3ebaa126e","epochOfferType":"savenow","billingProductCode":"SAVENOW25OFF1M"}},{"_uid":"49207516-a0fc-497b-9edb-ad1ea1909d8c","title":"Exclusive offer","content":"Get $50 in DIRECTV Visa® Reward Cards when you add DIRECTV Sports Pack with streaming device!","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/promo-rewards-blue700-giftcard-icon.svg","ranking":"2","legalCta":{"_uid":"cae4fbd1-7591-4bd0-8bfc-5631bc5b5bc2","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003ePROGRESSIVE DISCOUNT OFFER:\u003c/u\u003e Limited Time Offer. \u003c/strong\u003eReceive $5/$10/$15/$20 per mo. discount for first 24 mos. with min. ENTERTAINMENT pkg, then regular monthly price thereafter. Customer must activate streaming service with one Gemini device and account must remain in good standing to receive all discounts. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eFIRST MONTH DISCOUNT OFFER:\u003c/u\u003e Limited Time Offer. \u003c/strong\u003eReceive additional discount for first month ($30 w/ ENTERTAINMENT; $25 w/CHOICE, ULTIMATE or PREMIER. Discount automatically ends after one month. Customer must activate streaming service with one Gemini device to receive discount. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eVISA REWARD CARD OFFER:\u003c/u\u003e Limited Time Offer. \u003c/strong\u003eMust maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. Customer must order new DIRECTV streaming service plus device with ENTERTAINMENT, CHOICE, OPTIMO MAS or ULTIMATE Pkg. \u003cstrong\u003eand \u003c/strong\u003eDIRECTV Sports Pack add-on for $50 VISA Reward Card. Customers selecting DIRECTV Sports Pack \u003cstrong\u003eand\u003c/strong\u003e Peacock add-ons qualify for $100 VISA Reward Card. Customers selecting PREMIER package qualify for $50 VISA Reward Card without adding DIRECTV Sports Pack or $100 VISA Reward Card when adding Peacock. Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.). \u003cstrong\u003eRedemption:\u003c/strong\u003e Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be sent a Reward Notification email with instructions for claiming the reward on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com/' target='_blank'\u003e www.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Reward must be claimed by the date noted in the email (75 days from the date email was sent). If customer's email returns as undeliverable, a letter will be mailed via USPS 3rd class mail. Reward invitation expires if not claimed by the date noted in Reward Notification. Customers can track their reward status anytime via the DIRECTV Reward Tracker, which is located on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com/' target='_blank'\u003e www.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Allow three (3) weeks after receipt and verification of customer\u0026rsquo;s claim for delivery card. DIRECTV is not responsible for late, lost or misdirected card in mail. Not valid for purchase by groups, clubs, businesses or organizations. Void where prohibited, licensed, taxed or restricted. \u003cstrong\u003eLIMIT ONE $50 or $100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT. \u003c/strong\u003eMay not be combined with other reward card offers on same services. Card expires at month-end 6 months after issuance. For Cardholder Agreement, go to \u003cstrong\u003edirectv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/strong\u003e. The DIRECTV Visa Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDIRECTV SPORTS PACK 1 MONTH OFFER\u003c/u\u003e: Limited time offer. \u003c/strong\u003eRequires ENTERTAINMENT, CHOICE or ULTIMATE package. Customer must add DIRECTV Sports Pack (currently $14.99/mo.) and account must remain in good standing. After the first month, DIRECTV Sports Pack auto-renews monthly unless you change or cancel. Cancel anytime. However, once you've canceled DIRECTV Sports Pack, you can access it through the remaining monthly period. No refunds or credits for any partial-month periods or unwatched content. If you cancel your DIRECTV service, you will no longer be eligible for this offer. Blackout restrictions and other conditions apply to all sports programming. Regional Sports Networks included with CHOICE Package or higher. Actual number of channels and games varies by market. \u003cstrong\u003eLIMIT ONE DIRECTV SPORTS PACK OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT.\u003c/strong\u003e May be combined with other promotional offers on same services. Offer may be changed or discontinued at any time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003ePEACOCK 1 MONTH OFFER: \u003c/u\u003eLimited time offer.\u003c/strong\u003e Existing Peacock subscribers are not eligible. Requires ENTERTAINMENT package or higher. Customer must add Peacock and account must remain in good standing. After one month, Peacock subscription auto-renews monthly on your DIRECTV bill at then-prevailing rate ($7.99/mo.; subject to change) unless you cancel. Cancel anytime online. However, once you've canceled Peacock, you can access it through the remaining monthly period. No refunds or credits for any partial-month periods or unwatched content. Activation required to access Peacock Premium. Only valid for streaming using the Peacock app and peacocktv.com. U.S. only. Check your email for details on how to activate. If you cancel your DIRECTV service, you will no longer be eligible for this offer. \u003cstrong\u003eLIMIT ONE PEACOCK OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT.\u003c/strong\u003e May be combined with other promotional offers on same services. Offer may be changed\u003c/p\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"bdda0bfb-8185-4843-9b83-57b50f10f72a","epochOfferType":"hidden"},"cartContent":"Get a $50 DIRECTV Visa® Reward Card with DIRECTV Sports Pack! ","eligibleText":"eligible","notAppliedText":"not applied","isByodIneligible":true,"preSelectionContent":"Score a $50 DIRECTV Visa® Reward Card when you add DIRECTV Sports Pack! "},{"_uid":"5b1b7d07-01ae-4632-9b5e-a9e58b46e425","title":"Exclusive offer","content":"Get $50 DIRECTV Visa® Reward Card with DIRECTV Sports Pack and Peacock with streaming device!","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/promo-rewards-blue700-giftcard-icon.svg","ranking":"2","legalCta":{"_uid":"91e4cc12-4434-4422-903b-0674e50280e0","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003ePROGRESSIVE DISCOUNT OFFER:\u003c/u\u003e Limited Time Offer. \u003c/strong\u003eReceive $5/$10/$15/$20 per mo. discount for first 24 mos. with min. ENTERTAINMENT pkg, then regular monthly price thereafter. Customer must activate streaming service with one Gemini device and account must remain in good standing to receive all discounts. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eFIRST MONTH DISCOUNT OFFER:\u003c/u\u003e Limited Time Offer. \u003c/strong\u003eReceive additional discount for first month ($30 w/ ENTERTAINMENT; $25 w/CHOICE, ULTIMATE or PREMIER. Discount automatically ends after one month. Customer must activate streaming service with one Gemini device to receive discount. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eVISA REWARD CARD OFFER:\u003c/u\u003e Limited Time Offer. \u003c/strong\u003eMust maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. Customer must order new DIRECTV streaming service plus device with ENTERTAINMENT, CHOICE, OPTIMO MAS or ULTIMATE Pkg. \u003cstrong\u003eand \u003c/strong\u003eDIRECTV Sports Pack add-on for $50 VISA Reward Card. Customers selecting DIRECTV Sports Pack \u003cstrong\u003eand\u003c/strong\u003e Peacock add-ons qualify for $100 VISA Reward Card. Customers selecting PREMIER package qualify for $50 VISA Reward Card without adding DIRECTV Sports Pack or $100 VISA Reward Card when adding Peacock. Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.). \u003cstrong\u003eRedemption:\u003c/strong\u003e Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be sent a Reward Notification email with instructions for claiming the reward on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com/' target='_blank'\u003e www.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Reward must be claimed by the date noted in the email (75 days from the date email was sent). If customer's email returns as undeliverable, a letter will be mailed via USPS 3rd class mail. Reward invitation expires if not claimed by the date noted in Reward Notification. Customers can track their reward status anytime via the DIRECTV Reward Tracker, which is located on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com/' target='_blank'\u003e www.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Allow three (3) weeks after receipt and verification of customer\u0026rsquo;s claim for delivery card. DIRECTV is not responsible for late, lost or misdirected card in mail. Not valid for purchase by groups, clubs, businesses or organizations. Void where prohibited, licensed, taxed or restricted. \u003cstrong\u003eLIMIT ONE $50 or $100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT. \u003c/strong\u003eMay not be combined with other reward card offers on same services. Card expires at month-end 6 months after issuance. For Cardholder Agreement, go to \u003cstrong\u003edirectv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/strong\u003e. The DIRECTV Visa Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDIRECTV SPORTS PACK 1 MONTH OFFER\u003c/u\u003e: Limited time offer. \u003c/strong\u003eRequires ENTERTAINMENT, CHOICE or ULTIMATE package. Customer must add DIRECTV Sports Pack (currently $14.99/mo.) and account must remain in good standing. After the first month, DIRECTV Sports Pack auto-renews monthly unless you change or cancel. Cancel anytime. However, once you've canceled DIRECTV Sports Pack, you can access it through the remaining monthly period. No refunds or credits for any partial-month periods or unwatched content. If you cancel your DIRECTV service, you will no longer be eligible for this offer. Blackout restrictions and other conditions apply to all sports programming. Regional Sports Networks included with CHOICE Package or higher. Actual number of channels and games varies by market. \u003cstrong\u003eLIMIT ONE DIRECTV SPORTS PACK OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT.\u003c/strong\u003e May be combined with other promotional offers on same services. Offer may be changed or discontinued at any time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003ePEACOCK 1 MONTH OFFER: \u003c/u\u003eLimited time offer.\u003c/strong\u003e Existing Peacock subscribers are not eligible. Requires ENTERTAINMENT package or higher. Customer must add Peacock and account must remain in good standing. After one month, Peacock subscription auto-renews monthly on your DIRECTV bill at then-prevailing rate ($7.99/mo.; subject to change) unless you cancel. Cancel anytime online. However, once you've canceled Peacock, you can access it through the remaining monthly period. No refunds or credits for any partial-month periods or unwatched content. Activation required to access Peacock Premium. Only valid for streaming using the Peacock app and peacocktv.com. U.S. only. Check your email for details on how to activate. If you cancel your DIRECTV service, you will no longer be eligible for this offer. \u003cstrong\u003eLIMIT ONE PEACOCK OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT.\u003c/strong\u003e May be combined with other promotional offers on same services. Offer may be changed\u003c/p\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"70934ad9-8d7b-467f-be75-e93917850aa6","epochOfferType":"hidden","supportedOfferIds":["OF_1MOSPACKFREE_RR + OF_PEACOCKPRE_DVCCHOICE_RR","OF_SPACKLTP_RR + OF_PEACOCKPRE_DVCCHOICE_RR","OF_1MOSPACKFREE_SPACK1_RR + OF_PEACOCKPRE_DVCCHOICE_RR","OF_BOLT-SPACK2-202209_RR"]},"cartContent":"Get a $50 DIRECTV Visa® Reward Card with DIRECTV Sports Pack and Peacock! ","eligibleText":"eligible","notAppliedText":"not applied","isByodIneligible":true,"preSelectionContent":"Score a $50 DIRECTV Visa® Reward Card when you add DIRECTV Sports Pack and Peacock! "},{"_uid":"e12a1808-e4b2-4a05-a7c5-ff599362a10c","title":"Instant Savings","content":"Start streaming DIRECTV and save $30 your first month!","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"ef3de0a5-2802-45db-982f-c6fbcf313888","label":"Offer details","enable":false,"legalContent":"\u003cb\u003eSAVE $30 OFFER:\u003c/b\u003e Limited Time Offer. New customers only. Offer not available to existing DIRECTV or U-verse TV customers. Requires ENTERTAINMENT package (currently min. $94.99/mo. for 24 mos. + taxes \u0026 fees w/req’d $10/mo. Gemini lease fee). Prices subject to change for new and existing customers. Customer must activate service with one Gemini device to receive discount. You will lose this offer an