onal $10/mo. Gemini lease fee). You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV STREAMING APP ACCOUNT.\u003c/b\u003e May not be combined with certain offers. \u003cb\u003eOffer may be changed or discontinued at any time.\u003c/b\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"cfd91cd5-3df9-46ab-b120-76eac8be65d7","epochOfferType":"savenow","billingProductCode":"SAVENOW15OFF1M"},"isByodIneligible":false},{"_uid":"195d1059-cf2f-4709-8e86-1a4d7b0f1515","title":"Instant Savings","content":"Start streaming DIRECTV and save $30 your first month!","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"fdfff253-9890-4b2a-992c-84d4b5e7f8d5","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cb\u003eSAVE $30 OFFER: Limited Time.\u003c/b\u003e New and returning DIRECTV customers only. Requires ENTERTAINMENT package (currently $89.99/mo. for 24 mos.). You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV STREAMING APP ACCOUNT (WITHOUT GEMINI DEVICE).\u003c/b\u003e May not be combined with certain offers.\u003cb\u003eOffer may end or change at any time.\u003c/b\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"bbdffb80-dfd7-477d-b88e-4a51dc12068c","epochOfferType":"savenow","billingProductCode":"SAVENOW30OFF1MNODVC"}},{"_uid":"b804b2b6-9246-41cd-b876-5b4e89a13977","title":"Instant Savings","content":"Start streaming DIRECTV and save $35 your first month with streaming device!","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"7e3d7c9c-ad89-480b-ac66-77808466edbe","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cb\u003eSAVE $35 OFFER: Limited Time.\u003c/b\u003e New DIRECTV customers only. Requires ENTERTAINMENT package with Gemini device (currently $99.99/mo. for 24 mos. w/ req’d device lease fee). Prices subject to change for new and existing customers. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV STREAMING APP WITH GEMINI DEVICE ACCOUNT.\u003c/b\u003e May not be combined with certain offers. \u003cb\u003eOffer may end or change at any time.\u003c/b\u003e"},"promoType":{"_uid":"62fc20cf-ba72-43bc-ae97-23765174a427","epochOfferType":"savenow","billingProductCode":"SAVENOW35OFF1M"}},{"_uid":"05e5023e-98a7-4df5-8b63-9a772fa13030","title":"Instant Savings","content":"\u003cspan\u003eGet $[[promotionAmount]] off your [[packageName]] package for [[promotionDuration]] months with streaming device and Starlink service\u003c/span\u003e","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"8b963866-100c-4b4a-ab60-4211209db098","label":"Offer details","enable":false,"legalContent":"\u003cb\u003e$10 off for 24 Months:\u003c/b\u003e This is a limited-time offer. \u003cb\u003eMust order ENTERTAINMENT package or higher,\u003c/b\u003e Gemini device AND qualifying Starlink Internet service. Customer must activate both services and both accounts must remain in good standing to receive all credits. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel either service. Service continues monthly at then-regular prices after 24 months. LIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT. May not be combined with other offers. Offer may be changed or discontinued at any time."},"promoType":{"_uid":"0395a2ce-afbf-4a60-8007-5fa0c78c5b24","epochOfferType":"savenow","supportedPackages":["choice","optimo mas","premier","ultimate","entertainment"],"billingProductCode":"10OFF24MSTARLINK"},"isByodIneligible":false},{"_uid":"505f97c5-d836-4c7a-8087-c4541cfbffff","title":"Instant Savings","content":"\u003cspan\u003eGet $[[promotionAmount]] off your [[packageName]] package for [[promotionDuration]] months with streaming device! \u003c/span\u003e","iconUrl":"/assets/content/5dxndeve0g/svg/fusion-offers-dollar-blue900.svg","ranking":"1","legalCta":{"_uid":"344467bc-5f3c-4001-8ac1-f22448bbe2d6","label":"Offer details","enable":false,"legalContent":"\u003cb\u003e$10 off for 3 Months:\u003c/b\u003e New customers only. Offer not available to DIRECTV or U-verse TV customers switching to DIRECTV Streaming App+ Gemini. \u003cb\u003eRequires purchase and maintaining CHOICE and above and one device.\u003c/b\u003e Customer must activate service, and account must remain in good standing with at least one device to receive all credits. You will lose this offer and/or any portion of this offer if you cancel your service. Returning customers who disconnected service within previous 12 months are not eligible for this offer. LIMIT ONE OFFER PER DIRECTV STREAMING APP ONLY. May not be combined with certain offers. Offer may be changed or discontinued at any time."},"promoType":{"_uid":"342769c7-0f0f-44eb-9efc-ed4e5b32711d","epochOfferType":"savenow","supportedPackages":["optimo mas","premier","ultimate","entertainment"]},"isByodIneligible":false}],"expandOnBreakpoints":["md","lg","xl"],"autoApplyRewardsFromEpoch":[{"_uid":"99c5180c-9820-4a93-82b6-fc3ca6c86593","title":"Instant Savings","content":"\u003cspan\u003eWith [[packageName]][[tradeMark]] you scored a $100 VISA Reward Card!\u003c/span\u003e","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/promo-rewards-blue700-giftcard-icon.svg","ranking":"0","legalCta":{"_uid":"4673d4e1-25cf-4ca8-9fa7-96c5e679eb01","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003e$100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e Limited Time Offer. Must maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. Customer must order new DIRECTV service (min. $69.99/mo. for 24 mos. plus taxes \u0026 fees) for VISA Reward Card. Autopay and Paperless Bill req’d. for Satellite.  Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.).  \u003cb\u003eAdditional Fees \u0026 Taxes:\u003c/b\u003e Price excludes Advanced Receiver Service Fee of $15/mo. (which is extra and applies to all packages) and Regional Sports Fee of up to $23.99/mo. which is extra \u0026 applies to CHOICE and/or MÁS ULTRA and higher Pkgs. \u003cb\u003eRedemption:\u003c/b\u003e Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be sent a Reward Notification email with instructions for claiming the reward on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com/'\u003e www.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Reward must be claimed by the date noted in the email (75 days from the date email was sent). If customer’s email returns as undeliverable, a letter will be mailed via USPS 3rd class mail. Reward invitation expires if not claimed by the date noted in Reward Notification. Customers can track their reward status anytime via the DIRECTV Reward Tracker, which is located on the DIRECTV Reward Center www.directv-rewardcenter.com.  Allow three (3) weeks after receipt and verification of customer’s claim for delivery card. DIRECTV is not responsible for late, lost or misdirected card in mail. Not valid for purchase by groups, clubs, businesses or organizations. Void where prohibited, licensed, taxed or restricted. \u003cb\u003eLIMIT ONE $100 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER PER DIRECTV ACCOUNT.\u003c/b\u003e May not be combined with other reward card offers on same services. Card expires at month-end 6 months after issuance. For Cardholder Agreement, go to \u003cb\u003edirectv-rewardcenter.com.\u003c/b\u003e The DIRECTV Visa Reward Card is issued by The Bancorp Bank N.A. pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc. and can be used everywhere Visa debit cards are accepted in the United States, the District of Columbia, US Virgin Islands, and Puerto Rico. No cash access. The Bancorp Bank N.A.; Member FDIC. The Bancorp Bank N.A. does not endorse or sponsor and is not affiliated in any way with any product or service offered by DIRECTV."},"productSKU":"OF_REWARD-100-202311_RR_ALL_PKGS"},{"_uid":"466a2b0a-a0a0-4079-bae2-d5cb227d74e5","title":"Instant Savings","content":"\u003cspan\u003eWith [[packageName]][[tradeMark]] you scored a $50 VISA Reward Card!\u003c/span\u003e","iconUrl":"/dtvassets/global/icons/fusion/promo-rewards-blue700-giftcard-icon.svg","ranking":"0","legalCta":{"_uid":"b1dcf82f-8da1-45a3-8792-5592981d538a","label":"Offer details","legalContent":"\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003e$50 VISA REWARD CARD OFFER:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e Limited Time Offer. Must maintain service through reward fulfillment to remain eligible for offer. Customer must order new DIRECTV service (min. $69.99/mo. for 24 mos. plus taxes \u0026 fees) for VISA Reward Card. Autopay and Paperless Bill req’d. for Satellite.  Must select offer at point of sale through the dedicated website, for new residential customers in the U.S. (excludes Puerto Rico and U.S.V.I.).  \u003cb\u003eAdditional Fees \u0026 Taxes:\u003c/b\u003e Price excludes Advanced Receiver Service Fee of $15/mo. (which is extra and applies to all packages) and Regional Sports Fee of up to $23.99/mo. which is extra \u0026 applies to CHOICE and/or MÁS ULTRA and higher Pkgs. \u003cb\u003eRedemption:\u003c/b\u003e Within 6 weeks of activation of qualified service, eligible customers will be sent a Reward Notification email with instructions for claiming the reward on the DIRECTV Reward Center \u003ca href='http://www.directv-rewardcenter.com/'\u003e www.directv-rewardcenter.com\u003c/a\u003e. Reward must be claimed by the date noted in the email (75 days from the date email was sent). If customer’s email returns as undeliverable, a letter will be mailed via USPS 3rd class mail. Reward invitation expires if not claimed by the date noted in Reward Notification. Customers can track their reward status anytime via the DIRECTV Reward Tracker, which is located on the DIRECTV Reward Center www.directv-rewardcenter.com.  Allow three (3) weeks after receipt a