months, Sports Pack will auto-renew monthly at then-prevailing rate (currently [[priceText]]) unless you change or cancel. Requires account stay in good standing. If you cancel your service, you will no longer be eligible for this offer.\u003c/p\u003e","billingProductCode":"3MOSPACKFREE"},{"_uid":"0d2c1186-3cd5-485c-bdab-70bb9eff4e79","legal":"","heading":"$0 for 1 mo. then [[priceText]]","component":"deviceBasedPromotions","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eGet your first month of DIRECTV Sports Pack on us!\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003ew/ CHOICE or ULTIMATE package. Ltd. time offer. New resid. customers. DIRECTV Sports Pack auto-renews monthly after 1 mo. at then-prevailing rate (currently $[[basePrice]]/mo. + tax) unless cancelled.\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith a monthly subscription to DIRECTV Sports Pack, you get access to specialty sports networks, pro networks, plus adventure programming, international soccer, golf, tennis, racing, and more. Also included, for those with a base package of CHOICE, ULTIMATE \u0026 PREMIER access to up to 35 out-of-market regional sports networks to view select live collegiate and high school games, as well as pre- and post-game commentary for select pro teams around the country.\u003c/p\u003e","billingProductCode":"1MOSPACKFREE"}]},{"_uid":"44edf7e3-7079-4e40-81bb-c5d257962a20","component":"common_dtvi","productSKU":"OF_BOLT-SPACK-202209_R","deviceBasedPromotions":[{"_uid":"5ed00aa0-bc71-42ff-a6f2-82632f7c3ef8","legal":"","heading":"3 months included, then [[priceText]]","component":"deviceBasedPromotions","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith a monthly subscription to DIRECTV Sports Pack, you get access to specialty sports networks, pro networks, plus adventure programming, international soccer, golf, tennis, racing, and more. Also included for those with a base package of CHOICE, ULTIMATE, or PREMIER, access to up to 35 out-of-market regional sports networks to view select live collegiat