OICE, ULTIMATE, or PREMIER, access to up to 35 out-of-market regional sports networks to view select live collegiate and high school games, as well as pre- and post-game commentary for select pro teams around the country. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFirst 3 months of Sports Pack, at no extra charge. After first 3 months, Sports Pack will auto-renew monthly at then-prevailing rate (currently [[priceText]]) unless you change or cancel. Requires account stay in good standing. If you cancel your service, you will no longer be eligible for this offer.\u003c/p\u003e","billingProductCode":"3MOSPACKFREE"},{"_uid":"75c2f818-467c-48d3-9e76-44b935642840","legal":"","heading":"$0 for 1 mo. then [[priceText]]","component":"deviceBasedPromotions","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eGGG TEST Get your first month of DIRECTV Sports Pack on us!\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eLtd. time offer. New resid. customers. DIRECTV Sports Pack auto-renews monthly after 1 mo. at then-prevailing rate (currently $[[basePrice]]/mo. + tax) unless cancelled.\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith a monthly subscription to DIRECTV Sports Pack, you get access to specialty sports networks, pro networks, plus adventure programming, international soccer, golf, tennis, racing, and more. Also included, for those with a base package of CHOICE, ULTIMATE \u0026 PREMIER access to up to 35 out-of-market regional sports networks to view select live collegiate and high school games, as well as pre- and post-game commentary for select pro teams around the country.\u003c/p\u003e","billingProductCode":"1MOSPACKFREE"}]},{"_uid":"41046014-8b26-42ec-808c-e069a324eca4","component":"common_dtvi","productSKU":"OF_2OFFAMCLT_ONLINE_RR","deviceBasedPromotions":[{"_uid":"652dda91-d516-442c-a4da-49620c2fc05e","legal":"","heading":"$2 off DIRECTV bill","component":"deviceBasedPromotions","description":"[[notificationText1]] AMC+ is [[basePriceText]] per month, price subject to change. By subscribing, you will receive $2.00 off the price of your monthly bill. If you cancel your subscription to AMC+, your $2.00 discount to your monthly bill will stop. By selecting this offer, you agree that your subscription to AMC+ auto-renews monthly at then prevailing rate (Currently [[basePriceText]] + taxes \u0026 fees) and that DIRECTV will charge the provided method of payment on a monthly basis, unless you cancel your subscription online via \u003ca href='https://www.directv.com' target='_blank'\u003eDIRECTV.com\u003c/a\u003e. May only be accessed on DIRECTV device(s), directv.com, and the DIRECTV app. Subscription not valid for streaming using the AMC+ app or \u003ca href='https://www.amcplus.com' target='_blank'\u003eamcplus.com\u003c/a\u003e. This offer is subject to discontinuation, change or cancellation at any time.","billingProductCode":"2OFFAMCLT"}]},{"_uid":"bd201ce0-d99e-4622-b91f-bd1faf9d2a18","component":"common_dtvi","productSKU":"OF_3OFFPEACOCKPRELT_RR","deviceBasedPromotions":[{"_uid":"a6152b5f-2a4b-468c-90a2-b9f4e5c6ac42","legal":"","heading":"$3 off DIRECTV bill","component":"deviceBasedPromotions","description":"\u003cp\u003e[[notificationText2]]\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSubscription activation required\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBy subscribing, you authorize DIRECTV to share your name, email address, and subscription status with Peacock to message you about your subscription for up to 12 months after your subscription ends.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe $[[price]] offer price includes $3/mo. off of Peacock Premium reg. price (currently $[[basePrice]]/mo.) for eligible customers. By subscribing, you will be billed $[[price]]/mo. (subject to change) on a recurring basis which will be charged to the payment method on file. Subscription only valid for streaming using the Peacock app and \u003ca href='https://www.peacocktv.com/' target='_blank'\u003epeacocktv.com\u003c/a\u003e. You will receive separate information via email on how to activate your account. Cancel service anytime by managing your DIRECTV subscription online. Existing Peacock Premium and Premium Plus subscribers will need to take additional steps to redeem, see  \u003ca href='https://www.peacocktv.com/help/article/directv' target='_blank'\u003epeacocktv.com/help/article/directv\u003c/a\u003e for details.\u003c/p\u003e","billingProductCode":"3OFFPEACOCKPRELT"}]},{"_uid":"9c4af9e2-dd3c-43b0-88e1-c8f9c45d50ad","component":"common_dtvi","productSKU":"OF_PEACOCKPRE_DVCCHOICE_RR","deviceBasedPromotions":[{"_uid":"e62f1984-7c30-4323-a9f1-e31a7ba1f326","legal":"","heading":"1 month included, then [[basePrice]]","component":"deviceBasedPromotions","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy selecting this offer, you agree to Peacock terms and conditions available \u003ca href='https://www.peacocktv.com/terms' target='_blank'\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e. Once your purchase is complete, we'll send you an email so you can activate your Peacock Premium subscription and start streaming.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlready have Peacock directly billed through Peacock? You’ll need to cancel your current Peacock plan first. Then, after your subscription has expired, return here to subscribe and have DIRECTV handle your billing. Visit the Help Center \u003ca href='https://www.peacocktv.com/help/article/directv' target='_blank'\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e for additional details.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWatch Peacock content on the Peacock app or peacocktv.com.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith this offer you will receive Peacock Premium at no extra cost for 1 month. By selecting this offer, you agree that your subscription to Peacock Premium auto-renews monthly and after promotional period DIRECTV will charge the provided payment method at the then prevailing rate (currently $[[basePrice]]/mo. + taxes), unless you cancel your subscription online via DIRECTV.com.\u003c/p\u003e","strikePrice":false,"regPriceText":"then [[basePrice]]/mo.","promoPriceText":"1 month included","billingProductCode":"1MOPEACOCKPREFREE"},{"_uid":"f72ae294-1d2e-43d2-a88c-5618e35e4fbf","legal":"","heading":"","component":"deviceBasedPromotions","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy selecting this offer, you agree to Peacock terms and conditions available \u003ca href='https://www.peacocktv.com/terms' target='_blank'\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e. Once your purchase is complete, we'll send you an email so you can activate your Peacock Premium subscription and start streaming.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlready have Peacock directly billed through Peacock? You’ll need to cancel your current Peacock plan first. Then, after your subscription has expired, return here to subscribe and have DIRECTV handle your billing. Visit the Help Center \u003ca href='https://www.peacocktv.com/help/article/directv' target='_blank'\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e for additional details.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWatch Peacock content on the Peacock app or peacocktv.com.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBy selecting this offer, you agree that your subscription to Peacock Premium auto-renews monthly at the then prevailing rate (currently $[[basePrice]]/mo.) and that DIRECTV will charge the provided method of payment on a monthly basis, unless you cancel your subscription online via DIRECTV.com.\u003c/p\u003e","strikePrice":true,"regPriceText":"(Reg. [[basePrice]]/mo.)","promoPriceText":"","billingProductCode":"3OFFPEACOCKPRELT"}]}],"pathName":"choice-package","pkgDetails":{"offerId":"OF_BASE-CHOICE-201811_RR_INTRO_SAVENOW_MANUAL","offerName":"Choice","offerCode":"OF_BASE-CHOICE-201811","ranking":510,"offerProductType":"video-plan","isBulkOffer":false,"isMDUBridePackage":false,"product":{"productId":"7545579313","displayName":"CHOICE","billingProductCode":"BASE-CHOICE-201811","baseBillingProductCode":"","billingProductId":"13843","numberOfChannels":"105+ live channels","language":"English","hboMaxIncluded":true,"offerChoiceGroup":{"groupName":"ACQFTBREChoiceGrp_20240625","groupSelection":"Individual","groupDesignation":"Optional","gr