atus with Warner Bros. Discovery. \u003c/p\u003e\nHBO Max Standard auto-renews after 3 mos. at then-prevailing rate (currently [[priceText]] + taxes) unless you cancel. Cancel anytime at directv.com. New customers only. Access HBO Max Standard only through HBO Max app or \u003ca href='https://www.hbomax.com/' target='_blank'\u003ehbomax.com\u003c/a\u003e. HBO Max Standard also includes HBO channels and On Demand on DIRECTV STREAM.","regPriceText":"then [[regPrice]]/mo.","bannerContent":"3 MONTHS INCLUDED","isOfferRibbon":false,"modalImageUrl":"/assets/content/j6akd76q4v/svg/Channel-Icon-HBOmax-100x100.svg","promoPriceText":"3 months included","isEligibleCustomer":false,"socialProofMessage":"43k+ added last month","trialLanguageLabel":"[[svodName]] subscription available for activation after the DIRECTV [[freeTrialDuration]]-day free trial period ends.","seeWhatYouGetContent":{"_uid":"c034c2e7-84c1-43a1-b337-e9f1d33cc10c","heading":"Enjoy 24/7 access to a huge library of the best entertainment.","listItems":[{"_uid":"d267beef-e4b1-40e1-86f7-eb9318482cbe","listContent":"TV. Streaming. On Demand"},{"_uid":"3b01f315-2acd-462c-a94f-d3ee7817ba97","listContent":"The latest, most addictive shows"},{"_uid":"33a7e1be-e68e-4a49-9d39-b88dbab68944","listContent":"New movies every week"},{"_uid":"6f393f07-1459-49e6-959c-d589e8647987","listContent":"Every episode of every season"},{"_uid":"4770b4e7-6ca9-4412-83e9-d98539485d7c","listContent":"Access to HBO Max app"},{"_uid":"05a46493-668c-48de-96f1-22c9215087bb","listContent":"Includes 7 channels","tooltip":["HBO\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e East","HBO\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e 2 East","HBO Comedy\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e East HD","HBO Family\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e","HBO Latino\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e","HBO Signature\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e East HD","HBO Zone\u003csup\u003e®\u003c/sup\u003e East HD"]}]},"svgMarkup":"\u003c?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" standalone=\"no\"?\u003e\n\u00