asePrice]] per month, price subject to change. By selecting this offer, you agree that your subscription to Disney+ Hulu Bundle Premium auto-renews monthly at the then prevailing rate (currently $[[price]] plus taxes/less discount) and that DIRECTV will charge the provided payment method monthly, unless you cancel. By subscribing, you will get a $[[promotionAmount]]/mo. discount off the monthly price of this subscription as Signature Package w/ Gemini device includes Disney+, Hulu Bundle (with ads). Discount ends if you change packages or remove device. Cancel anytime at directv.com. This offer is subject to change or cancellation at any time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAccount activation required. You will receive separate information via email on how to activate your account. Streaming only available via the Disney+ app or disneyplus.com. If you already have a Disney bundle, Disney+, Hulu, or ESPN subscription, it may be necessary to manage your plan to avoid multiple subscriptions. It is your responsibility to manage your subscriptions. © 2026 Disney and its related entities.\u003c/p\u003e","isIncluded":false,"displayBasePrice":false,"inclWith":"","isHidden":false,"isOffer":false,"category":"Premiums","showName":false,"showImg":true,"isSports":false,"offerPreselectDesignation":"optional","qualifyingBasePkgs":[],"conflictingOffers":[],"_uid":"c5771853-f73b-4bbf-81ac-323463dc6a9d","altText":"Disney Plus, Hulu Bundle","ribbons":{"_uid":"8e4b4a62-62fb-4f3d-98bd-81b27d05c51f","dollarIconUrl":"https://www.directv.com/assets/content/id8e97z4bd/svg/fusion-offers-icon-green700.svg","dealRibbonText":"INCREDIBLE DEAL!","showDealRibbon":false,"recommendedRibbonText":"RECOMMENDED","showRecommendedRibbon":false},"features":[{"_uid":"602255bc-27bc-4938-8e83-a6f39b2f0ae8","icon":"/assets/content/ejjxj7jk2o/svg/fusion-multiview-icon-blue900.svg","content":"Ad-free"},{"_uid":"f44aaa45-b606-43f5-a408-9582c3085d28","icon":"/assets/content/zyaxcmf06o/svg/fusion-group-collab-icon-blue9